{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":90,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"A Prayer of Moses, the man of God","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"Prayer","s":["H8605"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[1]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[3]}]},{"n":1,"text":"O Lord, You have been our dwelling place In all generations.","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[0]},{"t":", You have been our dwelling "},{"t":"place","s":["H4583"],"a":[1]},{"t":" In "},{"t":"all","s":["H1755"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"generations","s":["H1755"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Before the mountains were brought forth, And before You gave birth to the earth and the world, Indeed from eternity to eternity, You are God.","tok":[{"t":"Before the "},{"t":"mountains","s":["H2022"],"a":[1]},{"t":" were brought "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3205"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And before You gave birth to the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"world","s":["H8398"],"a":[5]},{"t":", Indeed from eternity "},{"t":"to","s":["H5704"],"a":[7]},{"t":" eternity, You are "},{"t":"God","s":["H0410"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"You return man to dust And say, Return, you sons of men.","tok":[{"t":"You return "},{"t":"man","s":["H0582"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"dust","s":["H1793"],"a":[3]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Return","s":["H7725"],"a":[5]},{"t":", you sons of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0120"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"For a thousand years in Your sight Are like yesterday when it passes by And like a watch in the night.","tok":[{"t":"For a "},{"t":"thousand","s":["H0505"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[2]},{"t":" in Your "},{"t":"sight","s":["H5869"],"a":[3]},{"t":" Are like "},{"t":"yesterday","s":["H0865"],"a":[5]},{"t":" when it passes by And like a "},{"t":"watch","s":["H0821"],"a":[8]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"night","s":["H3915"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"You sweep them away as with a rain flood; they are as in a sleep: In the morning they are like grass that comes up anew.","tok":[{"t":"You sweep them away as with a rain "},{"t":"flood","s":["H2229"],"a":[0]},{"t":"; they are as in a "},{"t":"sleep","s":["H8142"],"a":[1]},{"t":": In the "},{"t":"morning","s":["H1242"],"a":[3]},{"t":" they are like "},{"t":"grass","s":["H2682"],"a":[4]},{"t":" that comes "},{"t":"up","s":["H2498"],"a":[5]},{"t":" anew."}]},{"n":6,"text":"In the morning it flourishes and comes up anew; In the evening it is cut down, and it dries up.","tok":[{"t":"In the "},{"t":"morning","s":["H1242"],"a":[0]},{"t":" it "},{"t":"flourishes","s":["H6692"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and comes "},{"t":"up","s":["H2498"],"a":[2]},{"t":" anew; In the "},{"t":"evening","s":["H6153"],"a":[3]},{"t":" it is cut "},{"t":"down","s":["H4135"],"a":[4]},{"t":", and it dries up."}]},{"n":7,"text":"For we have been consumed by Your anger, And by Your wrath we have been troubled.","tok":[{"t":"For we have been "},{"t":"consumed","s":["H3615"],"a":[1]},{"t":" by Your "},{"t":"anger","s":["H0639"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And by Your "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H2534"],"a":[3]},{"t":" we have been "},{"t":"troubled","s":["H0926"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"You have set our iniquities before You, Our secret sins in the light of Your countenance.","tok":[{"t":"You have "},{"t":"set","s":["H7896"],"a":[0]},{"t":" our "},{"t":"iniquities","s":["H5771"],"a":[1]},{"t":" before You, Our "},{"t":"secret","s":["H5956"],"a":[3]},{"t":" sins in the "},{"t":"light","s":["H3974"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"countenance","s":["H6440"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"For all our days have passed away in Your overflowing wrath; We bring our years to an end like a sigh.","tok":[{"t":"For all our "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have passed "},{"t":"away","s":["H6437"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in Your overflowing "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H5678"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; We bring our "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to an end like a sigh."}]},{"n":10,"text":"The days of our years are seventy years, Or, if because of strength, eighty years; But their pride is labor and sorrow, For it is soon gone, and we fly away.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of our "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are seventy "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[4]},{"t":", Or, if because of "},{"t":"strength","s":["H1369"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"eighty","s":["H8084"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; But their pride is labor and "},{"t":"sorrow","s":["H0205"],"a":[11]},{"t":", For it is "},{"t":"soon","s":["H2440"],"a":[14]},{"t":" gone, and we fly "},{"t":"away","s":["H5774"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Who knows the power of Your anger, And Your overflowing wrath according to the fear that is due You?","tok":[{"t":"Who "},{"t":"knows","s":["H3045"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"power","s":["H5797"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"anger","s":["H0639"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And Your overflowing "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H5678"],"a":[5]},{"t":" according to the "},{"t":"fear","s":["H3374"],"a":[4]},{"t":" that is due You?"}]},{"n":12,"text":"Teach us then to number our days That we may gain a heart of wisdom.","tok":[{"t":"Teach","s":["H3045"],"a":[3]},{"t":" us then to "},{"t":"number","s":["H4487"],"a":[0]},{"t":" our "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[1]},{"t":" That we may gain a "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"Return, O Jehovah! How long? And repent concerning Your servants.","tok":[{"t":"Return","s":["H7725"],"a":[0]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":"! How long? And "},{"t":"repent","s":["H5162"],"a":[4]},{"t":" concerning Your "},{"t":"servants","s":["H5650"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Satisfy us in the morning with Your lovingkindness That we may give a ringing shout and rejoice all our days.","tok":[{"t":"Satisfy","s":["H7646"],"a":[0]},{"t":" us in the morning with Your lovingkindness That we may give a ringing shout and "},{"t":"rejoice","s":["H7442"],"a":[3]},{"t":" all our "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":15,"text":"Cause us to rejoice according to the days that You have afflicted us, According to the years that we have seen evil.","tok":[{"t":"Cause us to rejoice according to the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[1]},{"t":" that You have "},{"t":"afflicted","s":["H6031"],"a":[2]},{"t":" us, According to the "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[3]},{"t":" that we have "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"Let Your work appear to Your servants, And Your splendor, to their children.","tok":[{"t":"Let Your "},{"t":"work","s":["H6467"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"appear","s":["H7200"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to Your "},{"t":"servants","s":["H5650"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And Your splendor, to their "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"And let the favor of the Lord our God be upon us, And establish the work of our hands upon us; Indeed the work of our hands, establish it.","tok":[{"t":"And let the favor of the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H3068"]},{"t":" our "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[3]},{"t":" be upon us, And "},{"t":"establish","s":["H3559"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"work","s":["H4639"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of our "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[6]},{"t":" upon us; Indeed the "},{"t":"work","s":["H4639"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of our "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[10]},{"t":", "},{"t":"establish","s":["H3559"],"a":[11]},{"t":" it."}]}]}
